      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REGINETTA (4) is the horse to beat after a strong win in a NMW1Y at Ascot, where she was held up at the 150m but still finished well enough to score narrowly. She comes back to the midweeks now and looks to get every chance. Hard to knock what she's done thus far and she can extend her winning streak. HARBOUR RISE (3) resumes after winning at this track last campaign, beating Ace Queen Suited despite covering ground, and his recent solid trial indicates he's ready. Drawn the inside today and can resume on a winning note. BOSISTO (2) narrowly missed out in his last two runs here, the latest in 1MW Saturday company, so this easier assignment is a good opportunity for him to return to winning ways. STAR MARTINI (7) has a solid sprinting record and comes off a win at Northam. Drawn ideally and can repeat the dose. SIMPLY OUTRAGEOUS (6) trialled well coming in and is not to be discounted in his WA debut.",
